<h3>100% Declared‑Value Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>While the standard insurance certificate covers routine risks, a 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance is highly recommended for long‑distance road transport. This specialised coverage ensures that the vehicle is insured for its full market value throughout the entire transit period, protecting against theft, damage, or loss.</p>
<p>Transport providers that offer this policy typically include a detailed claim process, rapid reimbursement, and a clear liability limit that matches the vehicle’s appraised value.</p>
<p>When selecting a transport company, ask for a written statement of the insurance terms and confirm that the policy is backed by a reputable insurer. The policy should specify:</p>
